\b
\li1 
\v 6 \zwd Daniel|\zwd*, \zwd Ginnethon|\zwd*, \zwd Baruch|Q140047142\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 
\v 7 \zwd Meshullam|\zwd*, \zwd Abijah|\zwd*, \zwd Mijamin|\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 
\v 8 \zwd Maaziah|\zwd*, \zwd Bilgai|\zwd*,\f + \fr 10:8 \ft Bilgai is a variant of Bilgah; see Nehemiah 12:5.\f* and \zwd Shemaiah|\zwd*. 
\b
\li2 These were the priests. 
\b
\m 
\v 9 The Levites: 
\b
\li1 \zwd Jeshua son of \zwd Azaniah|id="Q139383032" t="2"\zwd*|\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 \zwd Binnui of the sons of \zwd Henadad|\zwd*|\zwd*, \zwd Kadmiel|\zwd*, 
\b
